WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.941
An incoming call opens the Incoming call window in the soft phone, even

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.849
when the panel is closed.

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:15.390
It shows the caller, the queue or who transferred the call, and any matched records.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.138
Answer connects the call.

00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:21.360
Answer and open also opens a matched record.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:27.160
Voicemail sends the caller to voicemail, and Ignore declines the call on this phone.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:32.186
A call from a queue arrives as an offer first, with a countdown,

00:00:32.186 --> 00:00:34.630
in My workspace and the agent bar.

